rule c2: a variable initialised to zero is laid out after the hash walk, in definition order, so the same names keep their declaration order (contrast)
cl /O2
obj
  section * .bss bss rw- size=0x18 align=4
obj
  symbol ?count@@3HA s*+0x0 external
obj
  symbol ?total@@3HA s*+0x4 external
obj
  symbol ?index@@3HA s*+0x8 external
obj
  symbol ?value@@3HA s*+0xc external
obj
  symbol ?width@@3HA s*+0x10 external
obj
  symbol ?height@@3HA s*+0x14 external
